{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36460","headline":"冬日旅怀 · 罗邺","name":"冬日旅怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"[乌]焰才沈桂魄生，霜阶拥褐暂吟行。\n闲思江市白醪满，静忆僧窗绿绮横。\n尘土自怜长失计，云帆尤觉有归情。\n几多怅望无穷事，空画炉灰坐到明。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗邺","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36460.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36460","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}